msgid "OD AI Content"
msgstr "OD AI Content"

#. Description of the plugin
#: od-ai-content.php
msgid ""
"Delivers WordPress content as Markdown that is easier for AI systems to "
"retrieve and understand."
msgstr ""
"WordPressコンテンツを、AIが取得・理解しやすいMarkdownとして配信します。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: od-ai-content.php
msgid "Olein Design"
msgstr "Olein Design"

#: includes/class-admin-diagnostics.php:144
msgid "View Markdown"
msgstr "Markdownを表示"

#: includes/class-admin-diagnostics.php:156
msgid "Run OD AI Content diagnosis"
msgstr "OD AI Contentの診断を実行"

#: includes/class-admin-diagnostics.php:217
msgid "The bulk diagnosis request could not be verified."
msgstr "一括診断リクエストを確認できませんでした。"

#. translators: 1: waiting count, 2: processing count, 3: completed count, 4: failed count.
#: includes/class-admin-diagnostics.php:238
#, php-format
msgid ""
"OD AI Content bulk diagnosis — Waiting: %1$d, Processing: %2$d, Completed: "
"%3$d, Failed: %4$d."
msgstr ""
"OD AI Content一括診断 — 待機中：%1$d、処理中：%2$d、完了：%3$d、失敗：%4$d。"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:77
msgid "Markdown output"
msgstr "Markdown出力"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:84
msgid "Output status"
msgstr "出力状態"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:92
msgid "Post types"
msgstr "投稿タイプ"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:100
msgid "llms.txt default"
msgstr "llms.txtのデフォルト"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:129
msgid "You are not allowed to access this page."
msgstr "このページにアクセスする権限がありません。"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:151
msgid "Control which public content receives a Markdown alternative."
msgstr "Markdown代替表現を提供する公開コンテンツを設定します。"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:169
msgid "Enable Markdown alternatives"
msgstr "Markdown代替表現を有効化"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:211
msgid "Include content without an individual setting in llms.txt"
msgstr "個別設定のないコンテンツをllms.txtに含める"

#: includes/class-admin-settings.php:214
msgid ""
"When enabled, existing and newly published content in the selected post "
"types is included by default. Individual content settings override this "
"default."
msgstr ""
"有効にすると、選択した投稿タイプの既存および新規公開コンテンツがデフォルトで"
"含まれます。コンテンツごとの設定は、このデフォルト設定より優先されます。"

#: includes/class-block-converter.php:312
#: includes/class-html-to-markdown.php:157
